  "tax_slabs": {
    "note": "India has two parallel tax regimes since FY 2020-21. Old Regime allows deductions (80C, HRA, etc.). New Regime has lower rates but few deductions. New Regime became default from FY 2023-24 onwards. All amounts in INR. Add 4% Health & Education Cess on total tax. Surcharge applies on higher incomes.",
